OL,3,GNEWSA'Biggest' Punch and Judy
OL,4,Acollection sells for #20k
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Britain'a largest collections of
OL,7,FPunch and Judy paraphernalia has sold
OL,8,Fat auction for almost #20,000.
OL,10,FThousands of items, including puppets,
OL,11,Fbooths and props, chess sets and
OL,12,Fpostcards, were acquired by actor and
OL,13,Fchildren's entertainer Frank Turvey,
OL,14,Fwho performed as Professor Mystral in
OL,15,FLincolnshire for many years.
OL,17,FThey had been stored by his family
OL,18,Fsince his death earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
