OL,3,GNEWSA'Biggest' Punch and Judy
OL,4,Acollection sells for #20k
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the lots went under the hammer on
OL,7,FTuesday, Darryl Kirk, from Heritage
OL,8,FAuctioneers and Valuers in Lincoln,
OL,9,Fsaid Turvey "collected anything with
OL,10,FPunch".
